column2:
By night vigil alone I, the vower, worship Shiva; I invoke Shambhu, giver of enjoyment and liberation;
agnipuran:193:4	boat for crossing the ocean of hell, Shiva, homage to you. Homage to Shiva, the peaceful, giver of offspring, kingdom and the rest,
agnipuran:193:5	giver of good fortune, health, learning, wealth and the path to heaven. Give me dharma, give wealth, give desires, enjoyment and the rest;
agnipuran:193:6	give me virtue, fame, happiness; give me heaven and liberation. The hunter obtained merit, the sinner Sundarasena.
